terra, Kickboxer x Wrestler, atleta olímpico x falastrão. Opostos em quase tudo, Dan Henderson e Michael Bisping protagonizaram uma das mais marcantes edições do The Ultimate Fighter. E a resposta do americano no octógono, no primeiro encontro entre eles, acabou colocando mais combustível na rivalidade." type="episode" contentRating="A12" duration="2255000" grandparentArt="https://images.frequency.com/video/7458796570805031034/solid/rectangle/w1920_h1080/1wgd0o0asnhjc11su8opb3bfhk.jpg" grandparentGuid="plex://show/6a58d0e7d86726f95bcd8ba6" grandparentKey="/library/metadata/6a58d0e7d86726f95bcd8ba6" grandparentRatingKey="6a58d0e7d86726f95bcd8ba6" grandparentThumb="https://images.frequency.com/video/originals/7458796570805031034/Texted/rectangle/ey634729kyze1ney6leqvecc0.png" grandparentTitle="AS GRANDES RIVALIDADES DO MMA - Episódio 02" grandparentType="show" hasGenericTitle="1" index="1" originallyAvailableAt="2026-05-09T08:48:31Z" parentIndex="1" requiresConsent="1" skipParent="1" thumb="https://images.frequency.com/video/7458796570805031034/solid/rectangle/w1920_h1080/1wgd0o0asnhjc11su8opb3bfhk.jpg" title="Episode 1" userState="0" year="2026"><Image alt="Episode 1" type="coverArt" url="https://images.frequency.com/video/7458796570805031034/solid/rectangle/w1920_h1080/1wgd0o0asnhjc11su8opb3bfhk.jpg"/><Image alt="Episode 1" type="coverPoster" url="https://images.frequency.com/video/originals/7458796570805031034/Texted/rectangle/ey634729kyze1ney6leqvecc0.png"/><Image alt="Episode 1" type="snapshot" url="https://images.frequency.com/video/7458796570805031034/solid/rectangle/w1920_h1080/1wgd0o0asnhjc11su8opb3bfhk.jpg"/><Genre filter="genre=620143f98578b9238e1cdb8a" id="620143f98578b9238e1cdb8a" key="/library/sections/home/all?genre=620143f98578b9238e1cdb8a" ratingKey="genre_620143f98578b9238e1cdb8a" slug="sports" tag="Sports" type="directory" context="tag.genre"/><Media beginsAt="1785384748" duration="2255000" endsAt="1785387003" id="6a620cca22c72857fe0bf6a4" live="0" 